# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Patient data must never enter this repository.
#
# MIMIC-IV is governed by a PhysioNet Data Use Agreement and may not be
# redistributed. The Penn Medicine and OneFlorida+ extracts are institutional
# data derived from protected health information. The rules below deny data
# formats by default, with no exceptions. This repository carries code only:
# result tables derived from those cohorts stay with the cohorts rather than
# travelling separately, aggregate or not. Do not add a `!` rule to re-admit one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

